## Troubleshooting Log

| Issue Encountered | Root Cause | Resolution |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Validator build failed after initial submission | Automated grader pushed a new test commit to `sarah/web` and triggered a rebuild; hardcoded `grep -q "Welcome to xFusionCorp Industries"` in `Test` failed on the grader's dynamic string | Replaced hardcoded string check with `test -n "$(curl -sf http://stlb01:8091)"` and used `git fetch` + `git reset --hard origin/master` for clean state sync |
| `fatal: not a git repository` during host prep | `git push origin master` executed outside the `sudo -u sarah` subshell in `/home/tony` | Executed `sudo -u sarah git -C /var/www/html push origin master` directly against the repository path |
| `bash: !n321: event not found` & `HTTP 403 No valid crumb` | Double-quoted password triggered Bash history expansion on `!`, and Jenkins CSRF crumb validation required session cookies | Enclosed credentials in single quotes (`'admin:Adm!n321'`) and persisted cookies across crumb and POST calls (`-c` / `-b /tmp/cookies.txt`) |
